{"lines": [{"text": "Why you should never keep all your money in one bank. Forty-two billion dollars left this one in a single day.", "start": 0.1, "end": 5.764, "spec": {"type": "hero", "title": ["WHY YOU SHOULD NEVER", "KEEP ALL YOUR MONEY", "IN ONE BANK"], "mood": "tense"}, "words": [["Why", 0.089, 0.167], ["you", 0.167, 0.223], ["should", 0.223, 0.357], ["never", 0.357, 0.536], ["keep", 0.547, 0.748], ["all", 0.781, 0.915], ["your", 0.915, 1.016], ["money", 1.027, 1.25], ["in", 1.25, 1.328], ["one", 1.328, 1.484], ["bank", 1.484, 1.875], ["Forty-two", 2.266, 2.701], ["billion", 2.712, 3.069], ["dollars", 3.069, 3.482], ["left", 3.493, 3.817], ["this", 3.828, 4.029], ["one", 4.04, 4.33], ["in", 4.487, 4.554], ["a", 4.565, 4.598], ["single", 4.609, 4.944], ["day", 4.944, 5.335]]}, {"text": "It was Silicon Valley Bank in California, the go-to bank for tech startups.", "start": 5.964, "end": 10.524, "spec": {"type": "map", "cam": [-98, 39, 2.0], "cam2": [-121.5, 37.0, 10], "pins": [{"at": [-121.96, 37.35], "label": "Silicon Valley Bank", "col": "red", "delay": 0.45}]}, "words": [["It", 0.08, 0.136], ["was", 0.148, 0.261], ["Silicon", 0.273, 0.693], ["Valley", 0.693, 1.034], ["Bank", 1.045, 1.375], ["in", 1.5, 1.602], ["California", 1.602, 2.261], ["the", 2.614, 2.705], ["go-to", 2.705, 2.977], ["bank", 2.977, 3.25], ["for", 3.25, 3.364], ["tech", 3.375, 3.591], ["startups", 3.602, 4.227]]}, {"text": "On March eighth, twenty twenty-three, it admitted a one-point-eight-billion-dollar loss on its bonds.", "start": 10.724, "end": 16.172, "spec": {"type": "loss"}, "words": [["On", 0.08, 0.17], ["March", 0.17, 0.477], ["eighth", 0.477, 0.784], ["twenty", 0.83, 1.057], ["twenty-three", 1.068, 1.682], ["it", 2.045, 2.136], ["admitted", 2.136, 2.443], ["a", 2.443, 2.523], ["one-point-eight-billion-dollar", 2.534, 3.955], ["loss", 3.966, 4.352], ["on", 4.364, 4.455], ["its", 4.455, 4.557], ["bonds", 4.557, 5.114]]}, {"text": "Founders panicked in group chats, and everyone pulled their money out with a few taps on their phones.", "start": 16.372, "end": 21.556, "spec": {"type": "panic"}, "words": [["Founders", 0.125, 0.443], ["panicked", 0.443, 0.818], ["in", 0.818, 0.898], ["group", 0.898, 1.17], ["chats", 1.17, 1.682], ["and", 1.898, 2.011], ["everyone", 2.011, 2.432], ["pulled", 2.443, 2.67], ["their", 2.67, 2.784], ["money", 2.784, 3.125], ["out", 3.125, 3.33], ["with", 3.341, 3.455], ["a", 3.466, 3.5], ["few", 3.5, 3.784], ["taps", 3.795, 4.125], ["on", 4.125, 4.182], ["their", 4.182, 4.284], ["phones", 4.295, 4.83]]}, {"text": "By the next morning, another hundred billion dollars was lined up to leave. That's eighty-one percent of all deposits.", "start": 21.756, "end": 28.356, "spec": {"type": "queue"}, "words": [["By", 0.091, 0.159], ["the", 0.159, 0.216], ["next", 0.216, 0.432], ["morning", 0.432, 0.864], ["another", 1.125, 1.409], ["hundred", 1.42, 1.693], ["billion", 1.705, 2.011], ["dollars", 2.011, 2.386], ["was", 2.398, 2.523], ["lined", 2.534, 2.807], ["up", 2.818, 2.909], ["to", 2.92, 3.0], ["leave", 3.0, 3.477], ["That's", 3.83, 4.011], ["eighty-one", 4.148, 4.5], ["percent", 4.511, 5.011], ["of", 5.216, 5.318], ["all", 5.386, 5.557], ["deposits", 5.557, 6.25]]}, {"text": "So regulators shut the bank down, less than two days after the bad news.", "start": 28.556, "end": 33.02, "spec": {"type": "closed", "cut": true}, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.261], ["regulators", 0.261, 0.818], ["shut", 0.932, 1.205], ["the", 1.205, 1.307], ["bank", 1.307, 1.58], ["down", 1.58, 1.898], ["less", 2.261, 2.409], ["than", 2.409, 2.557], ["two", 2.557, 2.784], ["days", 2.784, 3.227], ["after", 3.239, 3.42], ["the", 3.42, 3.477], ["bad", 3.477, 3.705], ["news", 3.705, 4.125]]}, {"text": "And about eighty-six percent of the money was above the insured limit of two hundred fifty thousand dollars.", "start": 33.22, "end": 39.148, "spec": {"type": "pie"}, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.159], ["about", 0.17, 0.432], ["eighty-six", 0.568, 0.989], ["percent", 1.0, 1.307], ["of", 1.307, 1.341], ["the", 1.341, 1.398], ["money", 1.398, 1.739], ["was", 1.966, 2.125], ["above", 2.125, 2.466], ["the", 2.466, 2.523], ["insured", 2.534, 3.114], ["limit", 3.114, 3.466], ["of", 3.716, 3.864], ["two", 3.966, 4.205], ["hundred", 4.205, 4.432], ["fifty", 4.432, 4.716], ["thousand", 4.716, 5.068], ["dollars", 5.08, 5.591]]}, {"text": "Then the government stepped in, and every single depositor got all of their money back.", "start": 39.348, "end": 43.86, "spec": {"type": "rescue"}, "words": [["Then", 0.091, 0.17], ["the", 0.17, 0.239], ["government", 0.239, 0.591], ["stepped", 0.591, 0.932], ["in", 0.943, 1.193], ["and", 1.432, 1.636], ["every", 1.795, 2.045], ["single", 2.057, 2.307], ["depositor", 2.307, 2.841], ["got", 2.955, 3.102], ["all", 3.136, 3.352], ["of", 3.364, 3.42], ["their", 3.432, 3.523], ["money", 3.534, 3.75], ["back", 3.761, 4.159]]}, {"text": "Would you have pulled your money out too? Tell me below.", "start": 44.06, "end": 46.604, "spec": {"type": "hero", "choice": true}, "words": [["Would", 0.091, 0.17], ["you", 0.17, 0.216], ["have", 0.216, 0.307], ["pulled", 0.318, 0.5], ["your", 0.511, 0.58], ["money", 0.591, 0.818], ["out", 0.818, 0.955], ["too", 0.966, 1.261], ["Tell", 1.636, 1.739], ["me", 1.75, 1.852], ["below", 1.852, 2.205]]}], "dur": 46.7}